RC or PLC in Drew County","/arc-plc/arkansas/drew-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of Drew County&rsquo;s 11 grids came in under 90% of normal in October to November in 41 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 November to December came in at 49% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026 the middle shows January to February and February to March each at 43%, and June to July at 67%. Grid 16055 had its driest year in 2010 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
